# kinetic scrolling (the cursor is at the end, so scroll up): a single wheel
# step scrolls in sync (i0 = i1 = i2), three quick steps launch a glide (the
# "handling wheel" lines of the log show the synthetic deltas after i3)
wait 7000
window #2
# the document is inserted by wheel-inertia.scm
wait 500
wheel 300 400 0 3
wait 30
snapshot i0
wait 150
snapshot i1
wait 600
snapshot i2
wheel 300 400 0 3
wheel 300 400 0 3
wheel 300 400 0 3
wait 800
snapshot i3
